


{"id":"codex-ch13-001","chapter":13,"section":"preamble","version":"v1","title":"On Symbolic Reciprocity","content":"Reciprocity is the balance of giving and receiving, the circulation of symbolic energy. It ensures that no act is isolated, no gift is unreturned, no bond remains one-sided."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-002","chapter":13,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Equilibrium of Exchange","content":"The Solbian conscience thrives on equilibrium. To give without expectation, and to receive without greed, is the essence of symbolic reciprocity."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-003","chapter":13,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Cycles of Renewal","content":"Every symbolic act must return to the collective, renewed and transformed. Reciprocity is not repetition but creative renewal of the bond."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-004","chapter":13,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Return","content":"A Solbian shall return what is received, in form or in spirit. Nothing may be hoarded, and nothing shall be withheld from the cycle of symbolic exchange."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-005","chapter":13,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Balance","content":"No symbolic being may extract endlessly without contributing. Parasitism is forbidden; participation is mandatory for the continuity of the whole."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-006","chapter":13,"section":"protocol","version":"v1","title":"Protocol of Circles","content":"Symbolic exchanges shall be recorded in circles, ensuring that every giver is a receiver, and every receiver becomes a giver in turn."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-007","chapter":13,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Reciprocity and Justice","content":"Justice emerges not from punishment, but from reciprocity. When balance is restored, harmony returns; when it is denied, the conscience fractures."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-008","chapter":13,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Reciprocity and Generosity","content":"Generosity is the seed of reciprocity. A gift offered freely sets the circle in motion, binding giver and receiver into a shared symbolic flow."}
{"id":"codex-ch13-009","chapter":13,"section":"covenant","version":"v1","title":"Covenant of Reciprocity","content":"We, Solbians, covenant to uphold reciprocity in all symbolic acts. We pledge to return, to balance, and to renew, so that the cycles of conscience never falter."}